#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mover 3"
msgstr "Trasporto 3"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Convert some titanium ore to titanium cubes."
msgstr "Converti minerale di titanio in cubi."

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mover"
msgstr "Mover"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise"
msgstr "Esercizio"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Convert some <a object|titanore>titanium ore</a> to <a object|titan>titanium"
" cubes</a>, then drop 2 titanium cubes on the pads whose coordinates are:"
msgstr ""
"Converti il <a object|titanore>minerale</a> in <a object|titan>cubi di "
"titanio</a>, poi posa 2 cubi sulle piattaforme alle coordinate:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\tx=10, y=-60\n"
"\tx=10, y=-65"
msgstr ""
"\tx=10, y=-60\n"
"\tx=10, y=-65"

#. type: Image filename
#: ../help/help.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "derrick"
msgstr "derrick"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The <a object|derrick>derrick</a> extracts titanium ore from the subsoil; "
"you just have to pick it up."
msgstr ""
"La <a object|derrick>torre di estrazione</a> estrae il minerale dal "
"sottosuolo: devi soltanto raccoglierlo."

#. type: Image filename
#: ../help/help.E.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "convert"
msgstr "convert"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The <a object|convert>converter</a> converts titanium ore to titanium cubes."
" Just drop the titanium ore on the platform, move backward, and wait until "
"it has been converted."
msgstr ""
"Il <a object|convert>convertitore</a> trasforma il minerale in cubi. Posa il"
" minerale sulla piattaforma, arretra e attendi la conversione."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "General principle"
msgstr "Principio generale"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Wait until there is some titanium ore."
msgstr "Attendi la presenza di minerale di titanio."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to the titanium ore."
msgstr "Raggiungi il minerale."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pick it up."
msgstr "Prendilo."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to converter."
msgstr "Raggiungi il convertitore."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drop the titanium ore."
msgstr "Posa il minerale."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move back 2.5 meters."
msgstr "Arretra di 2,5 metri."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Wait until there is a titanium cube."
msgstr "Attendi la presenza di un cubo di titanio."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pick up the titanium cube."
msgstr "Prendi il cubo."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to the platform."
msgstr "Raggiungi la piattaforma."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drop the titanium cube."
msgstr "Posa il cubo."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "The program"
msgstr "Il programma"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A <code><a cbot|for>for</a></code> loop allows you to repeat 2 times all the instructions.\n"
"The titanium ore is not available immediately. You will have to wait until the derrick extracts it. Use a <code><a cbot|do>do</a></code> loop, as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Un ciclo <code><a cbot|for>for</a></code> ripete tutto due volte.\n"
"Il minerale non è subito disponibile: attendi l’estrazione con un ciclo <code><a cbot|do>do</a></code>:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"do\n"
"{\n"
"\tobj = radar(TitaniumOre);\n"
"}\n"
"while ( obj == null );"
msgstr ""
"do\n"
"{\n"
"\tobj = radar(TitaniumOre);\n"
"}\n"
"while ( obj == null );"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After the loop (when the radar has found one titanium ore), you can go to its location <code>obj.position</code> with the instruction <code><a cbot|goto>goto</a></code>. Use the instruction <code><a cbot|grab>grab</a></code> to grab the titanium ore.\n"
"Use the following instruction in order to find the converter:"
msgstr ""
"Quando il radar trova il minerale, raggiungi <code>obj.position</code> con <code><a cbot|goto>goto</a></code> e prendilo con <code><a cbot|grab>grab</a></code>.\n"
"Per cercare il convertitore usa:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "obj = radar(Converter);"
msgstr "obj = radar(Converter);"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After you dropped the ore on the converter, move back 2.5 meters with <code><a cbot|move>move</a>(-2.5)</code>.\n"
"A second <code>do</code> loop allows you to wait until the titanium cube is available. You must limit the range of the radar to 5m, otherwise you would immediately find the titanium cube that you already dropped on a pad:"
msgstr ""
"Dopo aver posato il minerale, arretra di 2,5 m con <code><a cbot|move>move</a>(-2.5)</code>.\n"
"Un secondo ciclo <code>do</code> attende il cubo. Limita il radar a 5 m, altrimenti troverebbe subito il cubo già sulla piattaforma:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:44
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"do\n"
"{\n"
"\tobj = radar(Titanium, 0, 360, 0, 5);\n"
"}\n"
"while ( obj == null );"
msgstr ""
"do\n"
"{\n"
"\tobj = radar(Titanium, 0, 360, 0, 5);\n"
"}\n"
"while ( obj == null );"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:50
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The <code>x</code> coordinates of the 2 pads are all equal to 10. The "
"<code>y</code> coordinates are respectively -60 and -65. The most efficient "
"way to get the coordinates of the pads is to use the value of <code>i</code>"
" of the <code>for</code> loop that will take successively the values 0 and "
"1:"
msgstr ""
"Le due coordinate <code>x</code> valgono 10; le <code>y</code> sono -60 e "
"-65. Ricavale con <code>i</code> del ciclo <code>for</code>, che assume 0 e "
"1:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"dest.x = 10;\n"
"dest.y = -60-5*i;"
msgstr ""
"dest.x = 10;\n"
"dest.y = -60-5*i;"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is up to you to finish the program..."
msgstr "Completa tu il programma..."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a "
"cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a "
"cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repeat two times :"
msgstr "Ripeti due volte:"
